<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>药性总义 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%8D%AF%E6%80%A7%E6%80%BB%E4%B9%89/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 07:09:56 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%8D%AF%E6%80%A7%E6%80%BB%E4%B9%89/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>药性总义</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/0-2-yaoxingzongyi/</link><pubDate>Thu, 15 May 2025 20:16:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/0-2-yaoxingzongyi/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F/">本草经</category><description>《神农本草经》是我国最早的药物学经典，成书年代虽存争议，但其作为中医药理论基石的地位无可替代，现存版本为后世学者辑佚整理而成，收录365种药物并系统论述其药性、用法及临床原则，虽含汉代神学色彩内容，但核心药效理论至今仍具指导意义。</description></item></channel></rss>